# Runtime dependency set for the hft-engine on free-threaded CPython 3.14t.
#
# Derived from [project].dependencies in pyproject.toml. pyproject.toml is NOT
# edited: the project lock (uv.lock) resolves Python 3.12/3.13 only, so this
# separate input is compiled for 3.14t into requirements/runtime-py314t.lock.
#
# Excluded on purpose:
#   hftbacktest  no cp314t x86_64 wheel; strategies/mm_hawkes.py imports it, so
#                that strategy is research-only on 3.14t.
#   orjson       no cp314t wheel; its users (execution/router.py, fill_dlq.py,
#                checkpoint.py, order/adapter.py, gateway/dedup.py, recorder/wal.py)
#                must move to msgspec before the engine runs on 3.14t.
#   research / dev / monitor / bot extras (torch, optuna, rich, telegram, ...).
#
# Pins kept from pyproject.toml: shioaji==1.7.11, prometheus_client<0.25.
# uvloop is listed explicitly: shioaji[speed] only pulls it for python < 3.14.
